# Patterns excluded from the registry publish zip.
# The ComfyUI Registry's server-side Bandit scanner walks every file in
# the zip; excluding tests/docs/notes/scripts keeps the scanner surface
# limited to the runtime payload. `.comfyignore` is honored by the
# `comfy node publish` zip step (NOT by the scanner itself — the scanner
# still sees whatever's in the zip, so we additionally rewrite secret-
# shaped literals in tests below).
#
# Reference: comfy-registry-bandit-flagged.md (memory).
tests/
docs/
.github/
notes/
scripts/
workflows/
*.excalidraw
